---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CountyMunicipalityMap from '../../../../components/jurisdictions/CountyMunicipalityMap.astro';
import PublicRecords from '../../../../components/jurisdictions/PublicRecords.astro';
import { mchenryMunicipalities, mchenryCountyFindings, mchenryMunicipalitySource } from '../../../../data/illinois/counties/mchenry';
import { mchenryCountyRecords } from '../../../../data/illinois/counties/mchenry-records';
---
<BaseLayout title="McHenry County Surveillance | NoRec.US" description="County and municipal surveillance research for McHenry County, Illinois." active="surveillance">
<main class="page_shell">
<nav class="jurisdiction_breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/illinois/">Illinois</a><span>→</span><strong>McHenry County</strong></nav>
<header class="article_header"><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL SURVEILLANCE · MCHENRY COUNTY, ILLINOIS</p><h1>McHenry County</h1><p class="article_deck">McHenry County is now fully scaffolded at the municipal level. County systems remain separate from municipal equipment, and an unresearched city or village is not represented as surveillance-free.</p></header>

<section><p class="eyebrow">MUNICIPALITIES · COUNTY YEARBOOK</p><h2>Countywide municipal coverage.</h2><p>The current McHenry County yearbook identifies 30 cities and villages in or partly within the county. Huntley, Crystal Lake, and Woodstock presently have primary-record surveillance dossiers; the remaining municipalities are ready for records and contributions.</p>
<div class="map_legend" aria-label="Municipality map legend"><span><i class="legend_swatch legend_covered"></i><strong>Research available</strong></span><span><i class="legend_swatch legend_open"></i><strong>Unresearched</strong></span><span><i class="legend_swatch legend_cross_county"></i><strong>Crosses county line</strong></span></div>
<CountyMunicipalityMap county="McHenry" municipalities={mchenryMunicipalities} />
<div class="jurisdiction_cards municipality_directory">{mchenryMunicipalities.map(m => (<a href={`/illinois/counties/mchenry/cities/${m.slug}/`}><strong>{m.name}</strong><span>{m.form.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+m.form.slice(1)} · {m.status === 'documented' || m.status === 'partial' ? 'Municipal dossier available' : 'Research needed'}{m.crossCounty ? ` · crosses ${m.counties.join(' / ')} counties` : ''}</span></a>))}</div>
<p class="map_note"><a href={mchenryMunicipalitySource}>Official McHenry County Cities & Villages directory</a></p></section>

<section><p class="eyebrow">MCHENRY COUNTY SHERIFF'S OFFICE</p><h2>County-level findings.</h2><div class="finding_grid">{mchenryCountyFindings.map(f => (<article><span class="status_label">{f.status.toUpperCase()}</span><p class="eyebrow finding_technology">{f.technology}</p><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.summary}</p></article>))}</div></section>

<PublicRecords records={mchenryCountyRecords} />

<section><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH GAPS</p><h2>What the audit still does not establish.</h2><ul class="about_questions"><li>Current McHenry County Sheriff ALPR vendor, inventory, locations, retention, sharing configuration, audits, and authorized users.</li><li>Current surveillance inventories for the 27 municipal dossiers still marked unresearched.</li><li>Current UAS inventory and activity beyond dated statewide reports.</li></ul></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
